<!doctype html><html><head><title>Resource-only pressure</title><style>body{display:none}</style></head><body><article><h1>Retained static report</h1><p>This server-rendered article stays intentionally hidden and contains no executable script or event handler.</p><p>Its first section explains the retained document in enough detail to qualify as useful semantic prose while remaining entirely independent of optional stylesheet, font, image, or scheduler work.</p><p>A second section confirms that ordinary resource pressure must not be reclassified as failed author JavaScript. Reader recovery therefore has no automatic failure signal on this page.</p><p>The final section remains in logical document order for a deliberate manual Reader request, but the untouched hidden presentation stays authoritative after the resource-only refusal.</p></article></body></html>
